                     <p class="oj-normal">
                        <span class="oj-italic">read:</span>
                     </p>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top"  >
                     <div>
                        <p class="oj-normal">‘By 30 June 2025, Member States shall notify to the Commission, EBA and ESMA, in detail, the rules referred to in the first and second subparagraphs. They shall also notify the Commission, ESMA and EBA without delay of any subsequent amendment thereto.</p>
                     </div>’.</td>
               </tr>
            </tbody>
         </table>
